While wandering through the source code, I noticed that for various items 
(helm of brilliance, gauntlets of dexterity, and rings of strength) if you
hit yourself with a wand of cancellation, the bonus which these items gave
you was removed.  Oddly enough, this isn't the case with gauntlets of power.

I went into the game in wizard mode to test this, and, sure enough, when 
wearing a helm of brilliance and gauntlets of power, if I zapped myself,
only my intelligence and wisdom went down.  My 25 strength just kinda sat
there...

bemusedly,
